===Etymology===
{{affix|en|freeze|-er|id2=agent noun}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|UK}} {{IPA|/fɹiːzə/|lang=en}}
* {{rhymes|iːzə(ɹ)|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# An [[appliance]] or [[room]] used to [[store]] food or other [[perishable]] [[item]]s at [[temperature]]s below 0[[°]] [[Celsius]] (32° [[Fahrenheit]]).
# The [[section]] of a [[refrigerator]] used to store food or other perishable items at a temperature below 0[[°]] [[Celsius]] (32° [[Fahrenheit]]).

